30 Segundos — "E se todas as propostas do Lula virassem realidade por 30 segundos?" · credits

Everything visual is procedural (three.js code in this folder): city, promenade, sites, people, vehicles, signs. No image assets, no real logos, no likeness of any person.
Proposal content: summaries of the 2026 government programme registered with the TSE, from press coverage (see FACTS.md). The film presents them as proposals ("e se…"), not as results.

Fonts
- Overpass & Overpass Mono — Delve Withrington, Dave Bailey, Thomas Jockin (Red Hat) — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-Overpass.txt), via @fontsource

Voice
- OmniVoice (k2-fsa/OmniVoice) via VoiceStudio: a young male voice designed with "male, young adult" (voicestudio/ref_voice.wav), then cloned for every line at the original line lengths (voicestudio/lines.py)
- Speech check: Whisper small (MIT) via faster-whisper

Music (original composition, mix.py)
- Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)

Sound effects
- All synthesized in mix.py with core/audio/sfx.py (no recorded samples)

Libraries
- three.js (MIT), playwright-core (Apache-2.0), ffmpeg (LGPL/GPL)
